{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t在北京，外交部發言人郭嘉昆回應有關中俄美元首會晤的提問時表示，中方早前已介紹中俄美元首深圳會晤的有關安排，三國元首將就事關全球和平的重要問題，深入交換意見。<br/>\n<br/>\n他又說，中方會及時發布會晤的相關消息。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅宇光\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:43:59.337379+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T07:29:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:09:15.018882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:37:26.636942+00:00","content_hash":"36df22fae60294831a3b3d239d635eca2177b31c62f09b99f87fcbc94c052a45","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}